{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a538328358516b27fc6baedd18df29375103f0f181b5a553a3985397d395f7d7", "ja": "（雪山でのライブを終え、莉緒と旅館に向かっている。\n雪女に扮した莉緒は、儚げで見惚れてしまったな）", "zh": "（结束了雪山上的演出，现在正和莉绪一起前往旅馆。\n扮成雪女的莉绪身姿缥缈，让人不由得看入了迷。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "b50d0f72dd89de7360a6ea3fb4989794fa1373bfecc8c02189ed537fbd9a6866", "ja": "うふふ、最高に盛り上がったわね♪\n雪女の私に、みんなの視線が釘付け……くしゅんっ！", "zh": "呵呵呵，现场的气氛真是嗨到极点了呢♪\n大家的目光全都牢牢锁定在扮成雪女的我身上……阿嚏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1002_p", "source_sha256": "01fb8c41a1cb13656e7ae69d53c9998cbf7148fa9829d68913f339e10ea3c824", "ja": "大丈夫か、莉緒？\nもう少し温かくした方が……。", "zh": "没事吧，莉绪？\n还是再穿暖和点比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "364b967f6bff713d81289ca409dec3c85356f9dace2e7d806e00d71d0e934c5c", "ja": "ふふ、ありがと♪　でも大丈夫。旅館も目の前だしね。\nそ・れ・に、自慢のスタイルは見せていかないと♪", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢♪不过没关系。旅馆就在眼前了嘛。\n而・且・啊，不展示一下我引以为傲的身材可不行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c0cf7e3dfc73e1c5365a7dabc29f0530d9610a3cb0596954b130259577cd4c08", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。\nでも莉緒のこだわりはわかるが、風邪ひいたら……。", "zh": "嗯、也是……不过我明白莉绪的坚持，可要是感冒了的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "4321ba89548d2d3a7fd45a236d4d2757dc656bf60113dd3ca5277558f6a36b9c", "ja": "もう、心配性ねー。ライブで火照った体には、\nこれくらいがちょうどい……んっ、くしゅんっ……！", "zh": "真是的，太爱操心啦——演出后热乎乎的身体，\n吹这种程度的正合……唔，阿嚏……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fe1a89073ce396798bafd00fa62f6a58803de4e4e12512516a861726396fe557", "ja": "何度もくしゃみしておいて、何言ってるんだ。\n旅館に着いたら、温泉でしっかり温まってくれ！", "zh": "都打了好几个喷嚏了，你还说什么呢。到了旅馆后，去温泉里好好暖和一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "4a9e88a039327bb0bf00e817bd8a172c611e603ba4b0be539d7c6a25c195c73b", "ja": "もちろん、そのつもりよ。\nここの温泉はね、すっご～くお肌にイイらしいの♪", "zh": "我当然是这么打算的啦。\n听说这里的温泉对皮肤超～级好的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "f4ab018e99f0daeb3831f4f7bf1a85bf7389ff93cff82545fcb1a309ffe91684", "ja": "じっくり浸かったら、全身つやつやのすべすべに\nなっちゃうかも。ウフフ♪", "zh": "好好泡一泡的话，说不定全身都会变得光滑水嫩。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7fb1445975f347ad8645c897585a3b07f409b8fc90577824091108dcdd7f036f", "ja": "ライブの疲れも取れて、一石二鳥じゃないか。\n長湯しすぎて、のぼせないようにな。", "zh": "连演出的疲劳也能消除，可谓一举两得。\n不过别泡太久，免得头晕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "0d7f8c40d8d78f6e32ca719c06ec609f8aa9d6155e41707b8e7d567f135ca85e", "ja": "む～……。{$P$}くん、\nなんだか素っ気ないんじゃない？", "zh": "唔～……。{$P$}君，\n总觉得你也太冷淡了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "5b5fae1bdc00e03cbdfe21ff2284fdb1ea713b52a3db5be2a24871fd733a9850", "ja": "私とお泊まりするのに、ドキドキしたりしないの？\nお風呂上がりのセクシーな浴衣姿とか見たくないの！？", "zh": "和我一起过夜，你就不会心跳加速吗？\n难道你不想看看我洗完澡后穿着性感浴衣的样子吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b4813dc6adb4c93d8ff870e114c2f4c3925a486a8d7cbd02363f4e15ca4e0725", "ja": "ドキドキもなにも……。そもそも部屋は別だろう？\nそれに泊まりの仕事なんて、何度もあったじゃないか。", "zh": "心动什么的……话说回来，房间本来就是分开的吧？\n而且，留宿的工作也不是一次两次了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "b5063c7daef2c6e6c085626e83c8818cdc2e9dff59087f8bb165583d2b812403", "ja": "そうだけど……。日頃から自分を磨いてる身としては\nこういう時こそ、意識してほしいっていうか……。", "zh": "话是这么说……可我平时一直都在磨炼自己，正因为是这种时候，才更希望你能注意到我一点，怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "0042708e195fd57e4ce185a443fd83a3b8e5cbd714bc2d4310d4837c34bf9b6b", "ja": "こうなったら……あとでキミの部屋に押しかけちゃうん\nだからね！　そして、朝まで……。", "zh": "既然这样……我之后可要直接闯进你房间了哦！然后，一直到早上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f1bed682c29c5ea9da57919dc0d210ea36dbe67ac5a6e746f55e5b07110f8581", "ja": "ちょうどよかった！　新しい仕事の話があるんだ。\n今後の打ち合わせもしたかったしな！", "zh": "正好！我有份新工作的事要跟你说。也正好想和你商量一下接下来的安排！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0403_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0403_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "e52b19b65748caadf2bab95e6ebb75d16d73a36f19e41e918add3f17df586348", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そういう意味じゃ……\nもう、{$P$}くんのバカ～！", "zh": "诶！？不、不是这个意思……\n真是的，{$P$}这个笨蛋～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
